# Keep the Docker build context small: the cqlite-flight image only needs Rust
# source + manifests, not build artifacts, VCS, or other languages' outputs.
.git/
target/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
# field-repro.sh (issue #2289) writes fresh diagnostics here every run; if it
# stayed in the build context, `COPY . .` in cqlite-flight/Dockerfile would
# cache-bust on every run and force a full Rust recompile (brutal under amd64
# QEMU emulation — the FLIGHT_PLATFORM=linux/amd64 path).
trino-connector/docker/field-repro-artifacts/
test-data/datasets/
docs/
*.zip
nohup.out
